<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 3.03 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 3.03 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Friday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 3.03 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Oct 1			 3,300</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Oct		6,469</p>
<p> Average reserves to Sept 26			  8,616</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    3,033</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
